'''The Mask and the Baby''' (阿亀と赤子, ''Okame to Akago'', '''The Okame and the Baby''') is a [[:Category:Advent Stages#Sequential Advent Stage|Sequential Advent Stage]] that was added in [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]]. It has one stage, with an extra [[Continuation Stage]] that grants 1 Dark [[Catseye]] as a [[Catnip Challenges|Catnip Challenge]] reward. These stages are exact copies of [[The Pure Land (Merciless)|The Pure Land]] and [[Baby Fake (Merciless)|Baby Fake]] respectively. To unlock The Mask and the Baby, you must clear both Courts of Torment and First Errand.

