==Trivia==
*Prior to Version 15.5, this map was known as "The Tortoise and the Baby". "Tortoise" was a mistranslation stemming from how the Japanese word 阿亀 ''[[wikipedia:Hyottoko#Otafuku|Okame]]'' contains the word 亀 ''kame'', meaning "turtle" or "tortoise". 
**Prior to Version 15.6, the corrected version of this map's name was missing the swords.

